{"3364600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hunter's Path", "steam_appid": 3364600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to walk The Hunter's Path and prove yourself against the wild? Sharpen your instincts, load your weapons, and embark on the ultimate survival hunting adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Gather essential resources, craft necessary gear, and build shelters to protect yourself from the elements and predators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting:</strong> Use a variety of weapons and traps to track and hunt wild game. Make every shot count. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Building:</strong> Develop your survival kit with crafted tools and shelters. Adapt your strategies and fortifications to withstand the harsh wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Worlds:</strong> There are many different hand crafted worlds to explore and survive in.  From mountainous to grasslands and arid dirt filled worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scenario Based Levels:</strong> Try all the different scenarios The Hunter's Path has to offer.  Open world survival, extreme survival, cabin life, bear infestation and  others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Scenarios (Game Play Modes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thirst</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatigue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Tool Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Gun Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Crafting Stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tempurature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night Cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting Multiple Animal Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drying Food/Leather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Purification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleeping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food Spoilage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind Direction (Animals Can Smell)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Save Files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to walk The Hunter's Path and prove yourself against the wild? Sharpen your instincts, load your weapons, and embark on the ultimate survival hunting adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Gather essential resources, craft necessary gear, and build shelters to protect yourself from the elements and predators. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting:</strong> Use a variety of weapons and traps to track and hunt wild game. Make every shot count. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Building:</strong> Develop your survival kit with crafted tools and shelters. Adapt your strategies and fortifications to withstand the harsh wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Worlds:</strong> There are many different hand crafted worlds to explore and survive in.  From mountainous to grasslands and arid dirt filled worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sce